# dtx-scan staging. The cloud pipeline (no systematic-tss, no network) READS committed staging;
# a systematic-tss+network host (dev nightly / ser) refreshes + commits it BEFORE the 23h routine.
#
# Only the 5 WIRED scripted modes are read by gen-status-page (DTX_STAGING_MAP), so only those are
# versioned. Unwired portfolios (crypto/eu_dax/eu_uk/in/jp/metals/uk/us_ablite) and machine-local
# engine state stay ignored — they're regenerable byproducts nothing on the site consumes.
*.json
state/
!us_highvol.json
!forex.json
!etf_us.json
!etf_eu.json
!stockbox_nasdaq.json
